I always love it when an airport gives me something to do while I'm waiting.

31
00:01:25.240 --> 00:01:25.320
Yeah, me too.

32
00:01:25.420 --> 00:01:26.280
I appreciate it.

33
00:01:26.280 --> 00:01:26.340
Me too.

34
00:01:26.340 --> 00:01:32.000
You know, in the St. Louis airport, in the American Terminal, they have this whole play

35
00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:33.220
space for kids.

36
00:01:33.400 --> 00:01:34.360
Oh, those are great.

37
