I have a folder on my laptop called Our Trailers.

67
00:02:48.680 --> 00:02:49.360
Did you know that?

68
00:02:49.760 --> 00:02:50.080
Yes.

69
00:02:50.420 --> 00:02:54.920
Because when we were putting together pictures for our book, we have a whole chapter in

70
