our book that kind of gives you the behind the scenes of the hair and makeup trailer

71
00:02:58.640 --> 00:03:00.600
and sort of life off the set.

72
00:03:00.740 --> 00:03:04.360
But I think we're going to dig in even deeper on today's episode.

73
00:03:04.840 --> 00:03:05.420
We are.

74
00:03:05.660 --> 00:03:10.440
I think one of the things I was so tickled by is that I have a folder of all the stuff

75
