00:43:26.460 --> 00:43:29.060
I guess they also make a Cheerwine pound cake.

886
00:43:29.300 --> 00:43:33.000
I am very curious about this Cheerwine.

887
00:43:33.340 --> 00:43:34.860
I've not ever heard of this.

888
00:43:34.960 --> 00:43:36.060
I have never heard of it.

