00:43:36.120 --> 00:43:39.560
I'm going to have to ask my family if they've ever heard of Cheerwine.

890
00:43:39.560 --> 00:43:44.040
Can I take you on a short tangent about cherry-flavored soda, though?

891
00:43:44.320 --> 00:43:44.780
Yeah.

892
00:43:44.880 --> 00:43:46.120
What in the world?

893
00:43:46.420 --> 00:43:46.900
Okay.

894
00:43:46.920 --> 00:43:50.160
I was home in St. Louis and I was talking to my mom.

895
00:43:50.360 --> 00:43:55.420
Her father was a pharmacist and he owned a pharmacy, but this was back in the day when

896
00:43:55.420 --> 00:43:57.920
