918
00:45:11.680 --> 00:45:16.120
You know, we're always trying to come up with new products, but thank you for writing us.

919
00:45:16.300 --> 00:45:21.000
My mom said that, like, two years later, they came out with cherry Coke.

920
00:45:21.280 --> 00:45:27.760
And her dad has always believed that he was the inventor of cherry Coke.

921
00:45:28.520 --> 00:45:31.060
I love that's part of your family lore.

922
00:45:31.400 --> 00:45:33.160
Your grandfather had the idea.

923
