00:46:35.380 --> 00:46:37.080
I've never been on a float.

944
00:46:37.340 --> 00:46:38.800
I'm curious about it.

945
00:46:38.800 --> 00:46:40.860
And if I was going to do it with anyone, it'd be you.

946
00:46:41.060 --> 00:46:42.200
Well, that's for sure.

947
00:46:42.740 --> 00:46:43.140
Mm-hmm.

948
00:46:43.140 --> 00:46:43.960
Yeah.

